    "App Store Connect refuse toute capture porteuse d'une couche alpha, même entièrement opaque. C'est le motif de rejet le plus courant, et le plus déroutant : l'image paraît normale partout ailleurs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App Store Connect rejects any screenshot carrying an alpha channel, even a fully opaque one. It's the most common rejection reason, and the most baffling: the image looks perfectly normal everywhere else."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Store Connect refuse toute capture porteuse d'une couche alpha. Ce tirage vise le dépôt : laissez le canal alpha désactivé, sinon il sera rejeté.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App Store Connect rejects any screenshot carrying an alpha channel. This print is headed for submission: leave the alpha channel off, or it will be rejected."
          }
        }
      }
    },
