    "Chaque course a un cran de rappel. Un retour franc sous le doigt marque le retour à la valeur neutre.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every travel has a detent. A firm click under your finger marks the return to neutral."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chaque écran du panorama porte son accroche. L'appareil se cale sur la plus haute des deux, sans en recouvrir aucune.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each screen of the panorama carries its own caption. The device lines up with the taller of the two and covers neither."
          }
        }
      }
    },
