    "Densité de l'ombre": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shadow density"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Depuis la photothèque ou depuis Fichiers. L'image se cale au pixel dans l'écran de l'appareil, encoche et coins arrondis compris. Aucun recadrage n'est appliqué dans votre dos.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From the photo library or from Files. The image sits pixel-perfect inside the device screen, notch and rounded corners included. No cropping is applied behind your back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Des courses, pas des curseurs": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Travels, not sliders"
