    },
    "La cote 6,5 pouces du dépôt, 1242 × 2688 au pixel près : le format choisi dans l'éditeur est ignoré pour ce tirage. La couche alpha se règle ci-dessous, et App Store Connect n'en accepte aucune.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The 6.5-inch submission size, 1242 × 2688 to the pixel: the size chosen in the editor is ignored for this print. The alpha channel is set below, and App Store Connect accepts none."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La cote du cadre et son orientation, portrait ou paysage, annoncées en pixels en haut de l'écran de tirage. C'est elle que vous obtenez, au pixel près.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The frame's size and orientation, portrait or landscape, shown in pixels at the top of the print screen. That is what you get, to the pixel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La couche alpha se règle au tirage, sur tous les modes : « Conserver le canal alpha », juste sous le choix du mode. Elle part désactivée, parce que c'est ce que le dépôt exige.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The alpha channel is set at print time, on every mode: “Keep the alpha channel”, just below the mode picker. It starts off, because that is what submission requires."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La disposition « %@ » impose son format. Changez de disposition pour choisir librement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The “%@” layout imposes its size. Change layout to choose freely."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "La disposition « Bande » impose son format paysage. Les autres vous laissent choisir librement la cote de sortie.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The “Banner” layout imposes its landscape size. The others let you choose the output size freely."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Langue": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Language"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le bandeau est déjà paysage : seul l'appareil se couche.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The banner is already landscape: only the device turns on its side."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le cadre et l'appareil pivotent ensemble. Posez une capture paysage : elle remplit l'écran couché.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Frame and device rotate together. Use a landscape screenshot: it fills the sideways screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le cadre pivote. Le MacBook, déjà en paysage, reste d'aplomb.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The frame rotates. The MacBook, already landscape, stays upright."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le compteur d'épreuves est désactivé. Tous les modes de tirage et toutes les dispositions sont accessibles.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The proof counter is off. Every print mode and every layout is available."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le compteur est désactivé. Tous les modes de tirage sont accessibles.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The counter is off. Every print mode is available."
